#: ../../library/binascii.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`binascii` --- binary/ASCII conversions"
msgstr ":mod:`binascii` --- binarne/ASCII konverzije"

#: ../../library/binascii.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module implements conversions between binary data and various encodings"
" of it in ASCII form (in both directions).  It provides hex-string, base64, "
"and CRC-32 helpers commonly used when transmitting binary data over text-"
"only channels."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul implementira konverzije između binarnih podataka i raznih "
"kodiranja istih u ASCII obliku (u oba smjera).  Pruža pomoćne funkcije za "
"hex-nizove, base64 i CRC-32 koje se obično koriste pri prijenosu binarnih "
"podataka kanalima koji podržavaju samo tekst."

#: ../../library/binascii.rst:13
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: ../../library/binascii.rst:17
msgid ""
"Convert the bytes in the *data* object to a hexadecimal representation. "
"Returns a bytes object."
msgstr ""
"Pretvara bajtove u objektu *data* u heksadecimalni prikaz. Vraća bytes "
"objekt."

#: ../../library/binascii.rst:20
msgid ""
"If the additional argument *sep* is supplied it is used as a separator "
"between hexadecimal values."
msgstr ""
"Ako je naveden dodatni argument *sep*\\ , koristi se kao razdjelnik između "
"heksadecimalnih vrijednosti."

#: ../../library/binascii.rst:25
msgid ""
"Convert hexadecimal data to binary representation. Returns bytes string. "
"(i.e. inverse of hexlify)"
msgstr ""
"Pretvara heksadecimalne podatke u binarni prikaz. Vraća bytes niz. (tj. "
"inverz funkcije hexlify)"

#: ../../library/binascii.rst:30
msgid ""
"Decode base64-encoded data, ignoring invalid characters in the input. "
"Conforms to `RFC 2045 s.6.8 "
"<https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045#section-6.8>`_. Returns a bytes object."
msgstr ""
"Dekodira base64 kodirane podatke, zanemarujući nevaljane znakove u ulazu. U "
"skladu s `RFC 2045 s.6.8 "
"<https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045#section-6.8>`_\\ . Vraća bytes objekt."

#: ../../library/binascii.rst:36
msgid ""
"Encode binary data in base64 format, as in `RFC 3548 "
"<https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3548.html>`_. Returns the encoded data "
"followed by a newline character if newline is true, as a bytes object."
msgstr ""
"Kodira binarne podatke u base64 formatu, kao u `RFC 3548 "
"<https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3548.html>`_\\ . Vraća kodirane podatke iza "
"kojih slijedi znak za novi redak ako je newline istinit, kao bytes objekt."

#: ../../library/binascii.rst:42
msgid ""
"Compute CRC-32, the 32-bit checksum of *data*, starting with an initial CRC "
"of *value*. The default initial CRC is zero. The algorithm is consistent "
"with the ZIP file checksum."
msgstr ""
"Izračunava CRC-32, 32-bitnu kontrolnu sumu *data*\\ , počevši s početnim "
"CRC-om *value*\\ . Zadani početni CRC je nula. Algoritam je u skladu s "
"kontrolnom sumom ZIP datoteke."
